==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɛhcɪ/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛhcɪ|lang=is}}
* {{a|as an adverb|unstressed}} {{IPA|/ɪc(ː)ɪ/|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ekki||nothing|lang=non}}, from {{term|eitt|lang=non}} (neuter of {{term|einn||one|lang=non}}) + negative suffix {{term|-gi|lang=non}}, {{term|-ki|lang=non}}.

====Adverb====
{{head|is|adverb}}

# [[not]]
#: ''Ég er '''ekki''' Kira!''
#:: I'm '''not''' Kira!
#: ''Ég fer '''ekki''' í dag vegna þess að ég fann ekki vegabréfið mitt.''
#:: I'm '''not''' leaving today because I didn't find my passport.
# [[don't]]
#: '''''Ekki''' [[fara]]!''
#:: '''Don't''' [[go]]!

=====Synonyms=====
* (''not''): [[ei]] (''dated''), [[eigi]] (''dated'')

